  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631550a553d915345308b491/step-9ed0997f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place potato and carrot on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic and herb seasoning, drizzle with olive oil, then toss to coat.\n• Roast for 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631550a553d915345308b491/step-97be9730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! This spice blend is mild, but use less if you're sensitive to heat. Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. In a medium bowl, combine haloumi and All-American spice blend with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi, tossing, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Remove pan from heat. Add mild chipotle sauce and honey, tossing to coat. TIP: Chicken is cooked through when it's no longer pink inside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631550a553d915345308b491/step-7128c708.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the roast veggie tray, add baby spinach leaves. Gently toss to combine.\n• Crush corn chips (see ingredients) in their bag until roughly broken into pieces.\n• Divide roast veggie toss between bowls. Top with chipotle-glazed haloumi and crushed corn chips.\n• Serve with a dollop of light sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631550a553d915345308b491/step-c1c1e21d.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
